  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peacebuilding in the Borderlands around the Abyei Administrative Area</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Overall objective: To build resilience to conflict in the AAA and its borderlands by directly addressing three main threats to intercommunal coexistence and stability
Target groups: The ethnic and tribal communities of West Kordofan, the AAA, and Warrap State, stakeholders in traditional governance and peace infrastructure, and civil society. The project will have a particular focus on the Women, Peace and Security Agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
